{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"sq_sump_ledger_start","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sq_sump_ledger_start/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_nervous_trader_ledger.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":11,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"A man pressed against the alley wall, eyes darting between every shadow.","text_ko":"골목 벽에 눌려진 한 남자가 모든 그림자 사이로 눈을 빤히 바라보고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sq_sump_ledger_start/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":11,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"Nervous Trader","text":"You. You're not Authority? No, you can't be, you smell like combustion.","text_ko":"당신. 관리국은 아니지? 아니, 아닐 거야, 연소 냄새가 나니까."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sq_sump_ledger_start/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":11,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Nervous Trader","text":"Listen. There's a ledger. Hidden in the Sump. Names, transactions, memory trades that were never supposed to happen.","text_ko":"들어 봐. 장부가 하나 있어. 섬프에 숨겨져 있지. 이름들, 거래들, 일어나선 안 됐던 기억 거래들."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sq_sump_ledger_start/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":11,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Nervous Trader","text":"Find it. Bring it back to me. Or burn it. I don't care which, just don't let the Authority find it.","text_ko":"찾아 줘. 나한테 가져오든가. 아니면 태워 버리든가. 어느 쪽이든 상관없어, 관리국 손에만 넘어가지 않으면 돼."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"ec36f700699e5ee7340837f663c81012ec1999b4f91cb1ee8845967b24bb279a","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/sys